    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 22, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "走进淋浴房，<br>\n只见可可正在用手机拍下室内的情况。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Narrative001"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 24, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 26, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "你在拍什么呢？", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Hiro001"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 28, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 29, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Coco.Surprised1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 31, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "呀啊啊啊！？", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Coco001"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 33, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Coco.Pensive1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 35, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "什么嘛，是你啊希罗亲。<br>\n你能不能别突然搭话啊？", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Coco002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 37, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "她刚才大概是沉迷于拍照，<br>\n被我突然问话吓了一跳。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Narrative002"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 39, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Coco.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 41, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "但她的脸上<br>\n转眼间就写满了兴奋。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Narrative003"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 43, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyCamera", "line": 44, "indent": 0, "params": {"Offset": [-6.699999809265137, -1.7999999523162842], "Zoom": 0.5, "EasingTypeName": "SmoothStep", "Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 45, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 47, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "刚才我发现了这个涂鸦，<br>\n你看，是不是很厉害？", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Coco003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 49, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "啊……这个多半是诺亚干的好事。<br>\n真是的，到处乱涂乱画……<br>\n必须得把它擦掉。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Hiro002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 51, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "不不不，不准擦。<br>\n这个搞不好超有价值的呢。", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Coco004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 53, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……价值是指？", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Hiro003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 55, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "你不知道吗？<br>\n那个世界闻名的艺术家【气球】。<br>\n说不定就是诺亚哦！", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Coco005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 57, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我不太了解这方面的事，但对这个名字略有耳闻。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Narrative004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 59, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "据说是个搞街头涂鸦的神秘艺术家，<br>\n似乎还挺有名的……", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Narrative005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 61, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "诺亚的画的确有着非同寻常的魅力。<br>\n就算她真是个名人也不奇怪。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Hiro004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 63, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "对吧。我先把这个涂鸦拍下来，<br>\n之后搞不好会爆火呢。", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Coco006"]}},
    {"op": "PlaySfxModified", "line": 66, "indent": 0, "params": {"SfxPath": "Sfx_28", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 0, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 68, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "蹭蹭大红人的名气，<br>\n这样人家也能挤进当红主播的行列了。<br>\n嘻嘻嘻。", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Coco007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 70, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……原来你还打算着回家啊。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Hiro005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 72, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "哈？那肯定啊。<br>\n我一定要回家。不管动用什么手段。", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Coco008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 74, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "因为【我推】还在等我呢。<br>", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Coco009"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 76, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "看着她喃喃自语的侧脸，<br>\n我忽然想到，也许现在正是打探她的好机会。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Narrative006"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 78, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 79, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.2"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCamera", "line": 80, "indent": 0, "params": {"Offset": [0.0, 0.0], "Zoom": 0.0, "EasingTypeName": "SmoothStep", "Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 81, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.5"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 82, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [30.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 83, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Coco"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 85, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……想问你一个问题。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Hiro006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 87, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "关于前几天的直播。<br>\n除了那个地下设施以外，<br>\n你还知道什么别的信息吗？", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Hiro007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 89, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "你手里到底还掌握了什么？", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Hiro008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 91, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我直截了当地问道，<br>\n而可可听了明显有些不高兴。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Narrative007"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 93, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Coco.Angry1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 95, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……笨蛋。我怎么可能告诉你。", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Coco010"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 97, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Coco.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 99, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "要知道，随时随地都有可能有人变成魔女，<br>\n不知道有谁会突然对我怀有杀意。", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Coco011"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 101, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Coco.Angry1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 103, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "所以在这里的所有人！<br>\n没有一个可信的！", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Coco012"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 105, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我已经不想再死一遍了！", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Coco013"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 107, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Pensive1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 109, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "再什么一遍……？", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Hiro009"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 111, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "可可似乎是说漏了嘴，脸上的表情一下子僵住。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Narrative008"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 113, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Coco.Surprised1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 115, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "没、没啥，口误而已。<br>\n我说，你能去别的地方待着吗？<br>\n我要准备直播了。", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Coco014"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 117, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 119, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "在这里……直播？", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Hiro010"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 121, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Coco.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 123, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这里隔音很好，可能是因为墙壁厚吧。<br>\n所以我想试着在这里播一次看看。", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Coco015"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 125, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……可是说不定会有人来淋浴啊。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Hiro011"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 127, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Coco.Smile1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 129, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这个时间不会有人来啦！<br>\n而且要是真有人来我就不播了。", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Coco016"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 131, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Coco.Angry1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 133, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "行了，别碍事，走开走开！", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Coco017"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 135, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Coco.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 137, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "还是说你想和我一起播？", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Coco018"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 139, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Angry1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 141, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……不必了。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Hiro012"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 143, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 145, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（隔音啊……这是个有用的信息）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Hiro013"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 147, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "离开前，我装作漫不经心的样子，<br>\n扫了一眼整个淋浴房。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Narrative009"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCamera", "line": 149, "indent": 0, "params": {"Offset": [-5.0], "Zoom": 0.30000001192092896, "EasingTypeName": "SmoothStep", "Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 151, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（那个垃圾滑槽……<br>\n　能不能利用呢）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Hiro014"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCamera", "line": 153, "indent": 0, "params": {"Offset": [0.0], "Zoom": 0.0, "EasingTypeName": "SmoothStep", "Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 155, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我一边这么思考着，<br>\n一边走出淋浴房。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv08_Narrative010"]}},
    {"op": "Gosub", "line": 162, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv"}},
